WEBVTT

00:05:28.115 --> 00:05:31.744
and our ability to learn from it using AI,

00:05:31.744 --> 00:05:36.916
the dream of making medicine
without bias and truly personal

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:38.084
can be achieved.

00:05:38.584 --> 00:05:41.504
And that, of course, benefits all of us.

00:05:41.504 --> 00:05:42.671
Thank you.

00:05:42.671 --> 00:05:46.300
(Cheers and applause)